-- Realistic data for the migration upgrade test (supabase/tests/migration-upgrade.sh): loaded
-- after the migrations already released, before the new ones, which must keep every row.
-- (.psql, so the pgTAP runner does not take it for a test.)
-- Written for the schema as of its commit; the test always loads the version from the base
-- revision, so it matches the schema it is loaded into.

